title: "MdExplorer"
abstract: "Professional Markdown editor and project management application for Spec Driven Development. Combines a Markdown editor with Git integration, PlantUML diagrams, AI-powered features (with local LLM support), and PDF/Word export. Cross-platform desktop application for Windows, macOS, and Linux."
